{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114230","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1211423001:0":{"text":"諦めろ！俺は何も話さないぞ！","source_cn":"我什么都不会说！你们趁早放弃！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x370464CFBDE60B18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211423002:0":{"text":"だろうな。\nあんた、頭が悪そうだし、ほかの船員たちが作戦の話をしてるときも、どうせのけ者にされてたんだろ？","source_cn":"我猜也是。\\n看你这傻大个的模样，船员聚在一起讨论战术...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBD550CBC7ED19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211423003:1":{"text":"何だと！俺だって作戦ぐらい知ってる！言わないだけだ！","source_cn":"胡说！我知道！但我忠诚，我不说！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C4E2F2D7EF9901B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211423004:1":{"text":"知らないなら知らないって言えよ。誰も笑わないからさ。","source_cn":"说不出来就承认嘛，我又不会笑你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B4CA172CB4DD99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211423005:1":{"text":"どの船にだって、ハブられる奴が一人や二人はいるもんだ。別に恥ずかしいことじゃない。","source_cn":"一艘船上总有那么几个不被重视的边缘人物，没事，不丢人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x162FFD330C6A91F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211423006:1":{"text":"ち、違う！俺は知ってる！会議に参加したからな！","source_cn":"不……不！我知道！我参与了作战会议！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADFA98E4ADDF5641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211423007:1":{"text":"へぇ、本当に？爆弾を運ぶだけの下っ端が？","source_cn":"哎哟，谁信呐。你不就是个搬炸药的苦力么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD60E387E743194D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211423008:1":{"text":"違う！俺はここで錬金術師を守るよう、船長に言われたんだ！重要な任務なんだ！","source_cn":"我不是！船长派我在这里保护炼金术师！我的工作很重要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA444FC37BD3D3F42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211423009:1":{"text":"それぐらいの嘘、俺でも考えつくぜ。実は俺はホジキンがラスティーアンカーに忍び込ませたスパイだ！ってな。","source_cn":"这话我也能编，我还说我是霍德希金安插在锈锚港的间谍呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567FAFD637F6D2AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211423010:1":{"text":"嘘じゃない！船長は錬金術師を大事にしてるんだ！あの人しか開けられない扉があるからな！","source_cn":"我没有骗你！船长很重视那名炼金术师！因为有些门只有他才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB262AC3F4FFA8091","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211423011:1":{"text":"ほぉ、そいつはいい情報だ。あんがとよ、タコ頭の兄ちゃん。","source_cn":"嗯哼，不错的情报。谢啦，章鱼头老哥。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF284C2721096F3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1211423012:1":{"text":"しばらく休んでな。","source_cn":"现在，你可以好好睡一觉了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x389BE89E31BEDA82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1211423013:0":{"text":"うぐっ！","source_cn":"啊——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B60233400120F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:1211423017:0":{"text":"シンドバッドが手際よく相手を気絶させた……","source_cn":"辛巴达利落地打晕了对方……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x570187B378F7519F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1211423014:1":{"text":"なかなかやるな。","source_cn":"辛巴达，你倒是有一套。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x967E1CD85F251B53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1211423015:1":{"text":"こんなの、基本中の基本さ。","source_cn":"不值一提，基础中的基础。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C956C2C6D112DBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1211423016:1":{"text":"よし、さっそくあのバカが言ってた錬金術師とやらに会いに行こうぜ。","source_cn":"好了，我们去找找这傻瓜说的炼金术师吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD803EBAA78FF7A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:愤怒的死潮劳工":{"text":"怒れる死海の労働者","source":"愤怒的死潮劳工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:辛巴达":{"text":"シンドバッド","source":"辛巴达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"ソニア","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":4}}